          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukabonya mawiwi imbiri ya BWANA, hata kwa irangi jake jose nderetaneghe na kaung'a ra Jeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, kwa iro, orewishekerieghe Israeli kungia kaung'enyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
