              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matuku gha Peka mzuri wa Israeli, Tiglathi-pileseri mzuri wa Ashuru, ukacha na kuikaba mizi ya Ijoni, Abel-beth-maaka, Janoa, Kedeshi, Hazori, Gileadi, na Galilaya, isanga jose ja Naftali; ukadwa wandu wunyika hata Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Hoshea mwana wa Ela ukabonya sheshe aighu ya Peka mwana wa Remalia; ukamkaba na kum'bwagha. Ukabonya nguma wulalo ghwake mwaka ghose ghwa mirongo iwi ghwa kubonya nguma kwake Jothamu mwana wa Uzia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
