          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka ghwa kawi ghwa kubonya nguma kwa Peka mwana wa Remalia, mzuri wa Israeli, niko Jothamu mwana wa Uzia mzuri wa Juda uzoe kubonya nguma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orekoghe mundu wa irika ja miaka mirongo iwi na misanu ngelo orezoyagha kubonya nguma. Ukabonya nguma Jerusalemu kwa miaka ikumi na irandadu, mae orewangwagha Jerusha mwai wa Zadoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukabonya agho gherekoghe gha hachi imbiri ya BWANA, karakara na agho ghose gherebonyeroghe ni ndee Uzia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elaima ndereinjireghe aja andu kotasira wikakaia mighondinyi; wandu wikakaia wikifunyira vizongona na kufukira marumba mghondinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mabonyo ghose gha Jothamu oreghibonyereghe ghaandikilo andenyi ya Chuo cha Malagho gha Ngelo cha Wazuri wa Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matuku agho, BWANA ukazoya kuduma Rezini mzuri wa Siria na Peka mwana wa Remalia wilo na Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jothamu ukafwa sa weke ndee; ukarikwa chiaimweri na weke ndee mzinyi ghwa Daudi, na mwana wake Ahazi ukabonya nguma wulalo ghwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.38"
            ]
          }
        }
